OL,3,GNEWSAFresh hope for rejected #2m
OL,4,Awildlife hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal lover whose plans for a #2m
OL,7,Fwildlife hospital were twice rejected
OL,8,Fhopes it can still be built after
OL,9,Fintervention by the Planning
OL,10,FInspectorate.
OL,12,FSue Stubley, the founder of the Suffolk
OL,13,FHedgehog Hospital, wants to build Long
OL,14,FAcre Wildlife Hospital on 27 acres of
OL,15,Fland at Kirtling, near Newmarket, to
OL,16,Fsupport vulnerable animals from across
OL,17,FSuffolk, Cambridgeshire, Essex and
OL,18,FNorfolk.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
