OL,3,GNEWSAFresh hope for rejected #2m
OL,4,Awildlife hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project had "insufficient
OL,7,Fjustification", said planning officers
OL,8,Fat East Cambridgeshire District
OL,9,FCouncil, who rejected the plans in July
OL,10,F2025 and again in January, leading to
OL,11,Fan appeal to the government's Planning
OL,12,FInspectorate.
OL,14,FThe inspectorate has appointed a
OL,15,Fplanner to consider the application.
